flowchart TD
    Start([NOSTR Event Received]) --> CheckKind{Event Kind?}

    CheckKind -->|Kind 1| CheckMention{Has user<br/>p-tag?}
    CheckKind -->|Kind 4| ProcessDM[Process DM]
    CheckKind -->|Kind 6| ProcessRepost[Process Repost]
    CheckKind -->|Kind 7| ProcessReaction[Process Reaction]
    CheckKind -->|Kind 3| ProcessFollow[Process Follow]
    CheckKind -->|Kind 9735| ProcessZap[Process Zap]
    CheckKind -->|Other| Ignore[Ignore Event]

    CheckMention -->|Yes| CreateMention[Create Mention Notification]
    CheckMention -->|No| CheckReply{Reply to<br/>user's event?}

    CheckReply -->|Yes| CreateReply[Create Reply Notification]
    CheckReply -->|No| Ignore

    CreateMention --> GetAuthor[Fetch Author Profile]
    CreateReply --> GetAuthor
    ProcessDM --> GetAuthor
    ProcessRepost --> GetAuthor
    ProcessReaction --> GetAuthor
    ProcessFollow --> GetAuthor
    ProcessZap --> GetAuthor

    GetAuthor --> FormatContent[Format Notification Content]
    FormatContent --> CheckDuplicate{Already<br/>exists?}

    CheckDuplicate -->|Yes| Ignore
    CheckDuplicate -->|No| StoreNotification[Store in IndexedDB]

    StoreNotification --> UpdateState[Update React State]
    UpdateState --> CheckPreferences{Notifications<br/>enabled?}

    CheckPreferences -->|Yes| ShowToast[Show Toast]
    CheckPreferences -->|No| End([Done])

    ShowToast --> CheckSound{Sound<br/>enabled?}
    CheckSound -->|Yes| PlaySound[Play Sound]
    CheckSound -->|No| CheckDesktop{Desktop<br/>enabled?}

    PlaySound --> CheckDesktop
    CheckDesktop -->|Yes| ShowDesktop[Show Desktop Notification]
    CheckDesktop -->|No| End

    ShowDesktop --> End
    Ignore --> End

    style Start fill:#4a90e2
    style CreateMention fill:#2ecc71
    style CreateReply fill:#2ecc71
    style ProcessDM fill:#e74c3c
    style StoreNotification fill:#9b59b6
    style End fill:#95a5a6
